direction_557 = location "Stone Golem" about "Stone Golem\nStone golems are stones which ancient priests are said to have infused with life and employed as servants. With priests losing self-control subsequent to the War against Pathos, they attack all life in their vicinity." found "Karus" at 1774 557 in zone 1

On offer
    Say "Did you obtain the bottom? Now all I have left is the top. The prey for this hunt is Stone Golem. Ancient priests infused stones with life and employed them as servants. But they've lost self-control and have turned into savage monsters now..."
